  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut potato into fries. In a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water. Set aside.\n• Place fries on the lined oven tray. Sprinkle over garlic seasoning and drizzle with olive oil.\n• Toss to coat, spread out evenly and bake until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/642e57fd9f1d85a1280a39e5/step-d0615001.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Slice tomato. Drain haloumi and pat dry. Slice haloumi horizontally to get 1 piece per person.\n• In a shallow bowl, add the plain flour. In a second shallow bowl, whisk egg. In a third shallow bowl, place panko breadcrumbs (see ingredients).\n• Dip haloumi slices into flour mixture, followed by egg and finally in panko breadcrumbs. Set aside on a plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/642e57fd9f1d85a1280a39e5/step-403c9ea8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to coat the base over medium-high heat.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 2 mins each side. Set aside on a paper towel-lined plate.\n• Meanwhile, halve burger buns and bake directly on oven rack until heated through, 2-3 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/642e57fd9f1d85a1280a39e5/step-c73a2886.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Spread buns with 1/2 the mayonnaise and 1/2 the sweet chilli sauce. Top with baby spinach, tomato and haloumi.\n• In a small bowl, combine remaining mayo and sweet chilli sauce.\n• Serve with fries and sweet chilli mayo or your favourite dipping sauce.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/642e57fd9f1d85a1280a39e5/step-7d0648d8.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
